<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Works - Compendium Notations</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --fg: #18181b;
    --muted: #71717a;
    --border: #e4e4e7;
    --player-bg: #f4f4f5;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #09090b;
      --fg: #fafafa;
      --muted: #a1a1aa;
      --border: #27272a;
      --player-bg: #18181b;
    }
  }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 65ch; /* sideyテーマ標準の本文幅 */
  }
  nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  nav .site-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  nav .links a {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  nav .links a.active {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .track {
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .track:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .track h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .player-box {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background-color: var(--player-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  .player-box .play-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .description {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
  }
  .external-links {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .external-links a {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-right: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .external-links a:hover {
    color: var(--fg);
    border-bottom-color: var(--fg);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <nav>
      <a href="#" class="site-title">Compendium Notations</a>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="#">missives</a>
        <a href="#" class="active">works</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <h1>Works</h1>

    <article class="track">
      <h3>Aria in Concrete</h3>
      <div class="meta">2026 — Soprano, Jazz Piano, Hip-Hop Beat</div>
      
      <div class="player-box">
        <div class="play-icon">▶</div>
        <div>YouTube / SoundCloud Player (16:9 レスポンシブ埋め込み)</div>
      </div>

      <p class="description">
        声楽のコロラトゥーラ・アリアの技巧と、乾いたヒップホップのビート、ジャズピアノのループを交差させた実験作。クラシックの発声法を現代のトラックメイクの文脈に再配置しています。
      </p>

      <div class="external-links">
        <a href="#">YouTube ↗</a>
        <a href="#">Spotify ↗</a>
        <a href="#">Apple Music ↗</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="track">
      <h3>Nocturne for Rhodes &amp; Sampler</h3>
      <div class="meta">2026 — Electric Piano, Vocal Chop</div>
      
      <div class="player-box" style="aspect-ratio: auto; height: 152px;">
        <div>Spotify / SoundCloud オーディオプレイヤー埋め込み枠</div>
      </div>

      <p class="description">
        ローズピアノのコード進行を軸に、自身のソプラノの断片をサンプリングして構築したインストゥルメンタル小品。
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</body>
</html>　
